        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Infest Environs"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(healing, necromancy, primal)\n\nRequirements: The terotricus is in a swamp or forested area.\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe terotricus drains nutrients from nearby trees and undergrowth while simultaneously infesting them with fungal growth. All non-magical plant life (though not plant creatures) within a 60-foot emanation withers and sprouts foul mold and slimy mushrooms, removing any cover and concealment provided by trees and undergrowth. The terotricus is healed 200 Hit Points."
            },
